//! The `font-synthesis-weight` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property lets
//! you specify whether or not the browser may synthesize the bold typeface when it is missing in a
//! font family.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | none
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts-4/#propdef-font-synthesis-weight
//!
//! Author guide:
